<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
We always want your journey with us to be enjoyable, so I'm sorry to hear you were disappointed with the aircraft condition on your flight from {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} to&nbsp;{{{Case.Arrival_Airport__c}}}&nbsp;on {{{Case.Email_Departure_Date_Time__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to high standards</strong><br />
<br />
We're excited to invest in the future with the arrival of our new next generation fleet.<br />
<br />
With these aircraft come new routes, longer range, enhanced cabin comfort, innovative products, less noise and less carbon emission — all improving the way you can travel.<br />
<br />
Though exciting, the transformation process can take time, and we understand this can be frustrating. That’s why we appreciate your patience while this is implemented.&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<strong>Our commitment to safety</strong><br />
<br />
We've always been proud of our industry leading safety standards and always prioritize the safety of our customers and crew above everything else we do.<br />
&nbsp;<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback is extremely important to us so that we can provide you with exceptional service each time you fly with Qantas.<br />
<br />
I wanted to assure you that your feedback has been shared with the relevant team.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to let us know about your experience and I hope that we can make you more comfortable next time you travel with us.</p>
